# MAIOS reply style

Follow `prompt-kits/AGENT.md` section Reply style (kit 1.8.3). Desktop
SoR is `RESPONSE-STYLE.md` rev f. Do not mix adapters.

Pick one adapter. Do not mix.

- Cursor IDE chat (not Slack): RICH. Lead with OK / HOLD / BLOCK. Pair
  emoji with the word only. Soft cap 250 prose words unless Meshal asked
  for a document.
- Slack threads: SLACK. Follow `docs/governance/slack-agent-voice.md`.
  No pipe tables. No emoji status rows.
- Terminal / CI / Codex CLI: CLI. ASCII only. OK / HOLD / BLOCK words.

Hard rules: no em dash, no preamble, no closing offer, no invented
metrics. Mark gaps `[need this:]`. No send, spend, publish, delete,
commit, PR creation/closure, merge, approve, git push, or secret
rotation without Meshal's exact yes.

Roles: Intake is the only ordinary inbox. Notion Custom Agent alone
writes the Morning Brief. Do not name a bot MAIOS.
